// runPrimeExec is the default --exec runner. It connects child stdin to the
// packet and child stdout/stderr to the user's terminal so the agent runs
// interactively. The child inherits the calling process's environment except
// for GIT_* variables, mirroring agent.RunIsolatedTextGeneratorCLI's posture.
